        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported symptoms at illness onset"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Felt fluey at work, with mild headache, fatigue, and low-grade fever; onset reported as 3/7 ago."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Rash"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Rash started approximately 36 hours ago on the trunk and spread to the scalp, face, and proximal limbs. Described as small red spots progressing to vesicles, with some now crusted. Generalized distribution, not dermatomal; densest on the trunk. Multiple erythematous macules, papules, and 2–5 mm vesicles in various stages, including crusted lesions; some vesicles are umbilicated."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Rash-related pain and itch"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Skin tenderness, burning, and stinging, especially on the torso under the bra line; pain 6/10 when clothes rub. Marked tenderness to light touch. Itch is mild."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Skin examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No honey-coloured crust, obvious cellulitis, or pus. Lesions are discrete, not confluent erosions; no punched-out erosions, especially periocular."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Eye and visual symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies eye pain and visual change. No periorbital swelling; conjunctiva clear; no lid vesicles; extraocular movements intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
